Topic: AWS Disaster Recovery (DR) Strategies

As part of my AWS DevOps Interview Preparation Series, today we’ll dive into one of the most crucial areas for business continuity and resilience — Disaster Recovery (DR) on AWS.

Every DevOps or Cloud Engineer should understand how to design and implement effective DR strategies that minimize downtime and data loss.
 Here are 30 real-world AWS Disaster Recovery interview questions to help you prepare for production-ready discussions. 👇

