 How can you test your DR plan in AWS?
 What is the importance of IAM and Security in DR scenarios?
 How can you achieve DR for applications hosted on Lambda (serverless)?
 How do you automate DR failover and failback in AWS?
 What are key monitoring tools for DR health and alerting?
